  FT["PH-H8713"] = {"id":"PH-H8713","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10260_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将南甘马粦省 Calabanga 市镇 Dominorog 描笼涯的 Calabanga 国立中学的 West Coast 附属校分离，改设为独立的同名国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Calabanga National High School - West Coast Annex in Barangay Dominorog, Municipality of Calabanga, Province of Camarines Sur From the Calabanga National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as West Coast National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Calabanga National High School - West Coast Annex in Barangay Dominorog, Municipality of Calabanga, Province of Camarines Sur From the Calabanga National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as West Coast National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu West Coast của Trường Trung học Calabanga Quốc gia tại Barangay Dominorog, Đô thị Calabanga, Tỉnh Camarines Sur khỏi Trường Trung học Calabanga Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học West Coast Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต West Coast ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Calabanga แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Dominorog เทศบาล Calabanga จังหวัด Camarines Sur ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Calabanga แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา West Coast แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus West Coast, Sekolah Menengah Calabanga Nasional di Barangay Dominorog, Kotamadya Calabanga, Provinsi Camarines Sur dari Sekolah Menengah Calabanga Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah West Coast Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus West Coast, Sekolah Menengah Calabanga Kebangsaan di Barangay Dominorog, Perbandaran Calabanga, Wilayah Camarines Sur daripada Sekolah Menengah Calabanga Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah West Coast Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10260","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-11-15","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10260_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8713-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into a National High School. – The Calabanga National High School – West Coast Annex in Barangay Dominorog, Municipality of Calabanga, Province of Camarines Sur is hereby separated from the Calabanga National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as West Coast National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8713-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. – All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Calabanga National High School – West Coast Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the West Coast National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8713-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the West Coast National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year’s appropriations of the Calabanga National High School – West Coast Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8713-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue such rules and regulations as may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8713-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p124","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Calabanga National High School - West Coast Annex in Barangay Dominorog, Municipality of Calabanga, Province of Camarines Sur From the Calabanga National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as West Coast National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
