  FT["PH-H8724"] = {"id":"PH-H8724","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10271_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将三宝颜锡布格省 Payao 市镇 Dalama 描笼涯的 Payao 国立中学附属校分离，改设为独立的 Dalama 国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Payao National High School - Dalama Annex in Barangay Dalama, Municipality of Payao, Province of Zamboanga Sibugay From the Payao National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Dalama National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Payao National High School - Dalama Annex in Barangay Dalama, Municipality of Payao, Province of Zamboanga Sibugay From the Payao National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Dalama National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Dalama của Trường Trung học Payao Quốc gia tại Barangay Dalama, Đô thị Payao, Tỉnh Zamboanga Sibugay khỏi Trường Trung học Payao Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Dalama Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Dalama ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Payao แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Dalama เทศบาล Payao จังหวัด Zamboanga Sibugay ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Payao แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Dalama แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Dalama, Sekolah Menengah Payao Nasional di Barangay Dalama, Kotamadya Payao, Provinsi Zamboanga Sibugay dari Sekolah Menengah Payao Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Dalama Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Dalama, Sekolah Menengah Payao Kebangsaan di Barangay Dalama, Perbandaran Payao, Wilayah Zamboanga Sibugay daripada Sekolah Menengah Payao Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Dalama Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10271","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-11-15","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10271_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8724-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into a National High School. – The Payao National High School – Dalama Annex in Barangay Dalama, Municipality of Payao, Province of Zamboanga Sibugay is hereby separated from the Payao National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Dalama National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8724-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. – All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Payao National High School – Dalama Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Dalama National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8724-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Dalama National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year’s appropriations of the Payao National High School – Dalama Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8724-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue such rules and regulations as may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8724-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p124","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Payao National High School - Dalama Annex in Barangay Dalama, Municipality of Payao, Province of Zamboanga Sibugay From the Payao National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Dalama National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
