  FT["PH-H8756"] = {"id":"PH-H8756","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10303_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Casiguran市","en":"The Judiciary Reorganization Act of 1980","orig":"An Act Creating a Regional Trial Court Branch in the Province of Aurora to Be Stationed At the Municipality of Casiguran, Amending for the Purpose Section 14, Paragraph (E) of Batas Pambansa Blg. 129, Otherwise Known as \"The Judiciary Reorganization Act of 1980\", as Amended, and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật Tái tổ chức Ngành Tư pháp năm 1980","th":"พระราชบัญญัติการปรับโครงสร้างองค์กรตุลาการ ค.ศ. 1980","id":"Undang-Undang Reorganisasi Kehakiman Tahun 1980","ms":"Akta Penyusunan Semula Kehakiman 1980"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["judiciary"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10303","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-11-15","completenessNote":"全文，共 4 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10303_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8756-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There is hereby created a branch of the Regional Trial Court in the Third Judicial Region to be stationed at the Municipality of Casiguran, Province of Aurora.\nThe Supreme Court shall assign the branch number of the newly-created Regional Trial Court branch in the Third Judicial Region."}},{"id":"PH-H8756-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"The Chief Justice of the Supreme Court, in coordination with the Secretary of the Department of Justice, shall immediately include in the Court’s program the operationalization of the Regional Trial Court branch to be stationed at the Municipality of Casiguran, Province of Aurora, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act. The funds necessary for the operation of the Court herein created shall be appropriated and released only upon the actual organization of the Court and the appointment of its personnel."}},{"id":"PH-H8756-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Section 14(e) of Batas Pambansa Blg. 129, otherwise known as \"The Judiciary Reorganization Act of 1980\", as amended, and all other laws, rules and regulations which are inconsistent with this Act are hereby amended, repealed or modified accordingly."}},{"id":"PH-H8756-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its complete publication in the Official Gazette or in two (2) newspapers of general circulation."}}],"pack":"ph-p124"};
  FT["PH-H8757"] = {"id":"PH-H8757","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10304_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Sagay市","en":"An Act Converting the Alangilan Elementary School in Barangay Alangilan, Municipality of Sagay, Province of Camiguin Into An Integrated School to Be Known as Alangilan Integrated School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Converting the Alangilan Elementary School in Barangay Alangilan, Municipality of Sagay, Province of Camiguin Into An Integrated School to Be Known as Alangilan Integrated School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật chuyển đổi Alangilan Elementary School thành Alangilan Integrated School","th":"พระราชบัญญัติเปลี่ยนสถานะ Alangilan Elementary School เป็น Alangilan Integrated School","id":"Undang-Undang mengubah Alangilan Elementary School menjadi Alangilan Integrated School","ms":"Akta menukar Alangilan Elementary School kepada Alangilan Integrated School"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10304","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-11-15","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10304_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8757-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Conversion into an Integrated School. – The Alangilan Elementary School in Barangay Alangilan, Municipality of Sagay, Province of Camiguin is hereby converted into an integrated school to be known as Alangilan Integrated School."}},{"id":"PH-H8757-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. – All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Alangilan Elementary School are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Alangilan Integrated School."}},{"id":"PH-H8757-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Alangilan Integrated School, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8757-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue such rules and regulations as may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8757-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect upon its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p124"};
  FT["PH-H8758"] = {"id":"PH-H8758","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10305_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将那牙市南甘马粦国立中学－Tinago 附属校从该校分离，改设为名为 Tinago 国立中学的独立国立中学并拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Camarines Sur National High School – Tinago Annex in the City of Naga, Province of Camarines Sur From the Camarines Sur National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tinago National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Camarines Sur National High School – Tinago Annex in the City of Naga, Province of Camarines Sur From the Camarines Sur National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tinago National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Tinago của Trường Trung học Camarines Sur Quốc gia tại Thành phố Naga, Tỉnh Camarines Sur khỏi Trường Trung học Camarines Sur Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Tinago Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Tinago ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Camarines Sur แห่งชาติในเมือง Naga จังหวัด Camarines Sur ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Camarines Sur แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Tinago แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Tinago, Sekolah Menengah Camarines Sur Nasional di Kota Naga, Provinsi Camarines Sur dari Sekolah Menengah Camarines Sur Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Tinago Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Tinago, Sekolah Menengah Camarines Sur Kebangsaan di Bandar Naga, Wilayah Camarines Sur daripada Sekolah Menengah Camarines Sur Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Tinago Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10305","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-11-15","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10305_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8758-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into a National High School. – The Camarines Sur National High School – Tinago Annex in the City of Naga, Province of Camarines Sur is hereby separated from the Camarines Sur National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Tinago National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8758-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. – All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Camarines Sur National High School – Tinago Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Tinago National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8758-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Tinago National High School, the initial funding of which shall he charged against the current year’s appropriations of the Camarines Sur National High School – Tinago Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall he included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8758-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue rules and regulations that may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8758-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p124","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Camarines Sur National High School – Tinago Annex in the City of Naga, Province of Camarines Sur From the Camarines Sur National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tinago National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
